#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin_notifications/__init__.py
msgid "Built-in notifications"
msgstr "Jakinarazpen integratuak"

#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin_notifications/__init__.py
msgid "The ways Postulo can tell you, or a machine, that something happened without installing anything: a notification in your browser, an email, a signed message posted to an address. This is the switch for all three at once; each can still be switched off on its own while this is on. Switched off, none of them sends, and what was set up stays as it is."
msgstr "Postulok zuri edo makina bati zerbait gertatu dela jakinarazteko dituen bideak, ezer instalatu gabe: jakinarazpen bat zure nabigatzailean, mezu elektroniko bat, helbide batera bidalitako mezu sinatu bat. Hau hirurentzako etengailua da aldi berean; bakoitza bere aldetik itzal daiteke hau piztuta dagoen bitartean. Itzalita, horietako batek ere ez du ezer bidaltzen, eta konfiguratutakoa dagoen bezala geratzen da."
